nd his heavy ornate iron bed in this house. Every night he slept soundly in his tiny dark bedroom. One night he was invited to the Kremlin. It was a long festive celebration.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le02ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "When he got home, his door was open. He raced up the long steep wooden stairs to his bedroom. Pieces of the wall covered the floor. His money was gone! He ran back down to the street screaming and died in front of his home.", "id": 2, "time": "23000", "image": "engenn5le02ob09re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "Now, at night, a thin old man in old-fashioned tattered clothes walks the streets. He cries out \u201cMy money is gone gone gone\u201d.", "id": 3, "time": "40500", "image": "engenn5le02ob09re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "text", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: This is where the ghost of a poor old sad man walks. He was a wealthy, greedy man. He hid his coins in the wall behind his heavy ornate iron bed in this house. Every night he slept soundly in his tiny dark bedroom. One night he was invited to the Kremlin. It was a long festive celebration.<br/><br/>\nWhen he got home, his door was open. He raced up the long steep wooden stairs to his bedroom. Pieces of the wall covered the floor. His money was gone! He ran back down to the street screaming and died in front of his home.<br/><br/>\nNow, at night, a thin old man in old-fashioned tattered clothes walks the streets. He cries out \u201cMy money is gone gone gone\u201d."}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally in Russia"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Visiting a Haunted House  "}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "o