_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "This is where the ghost of a poor old sad man walks. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He was a wealthy, greedy man.  "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wealthy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having a lot of money"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He was a very wealthy man.  He could buy anything."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you tell a ghost story."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "greedy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "always wanting more  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They were greedy. The never spent any money. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "festive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "cheerful; joyful "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Her birthday party was a festive celebration.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to scream"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to cry or say something loudly in a high voice"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He screamed as he ran into the street. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tattered"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "old and worn; with holes and marks  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: His jacket was old-fashioned and tattered. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to cry out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to shout or make a loud noise when you are frightened or hurt"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He cried out for help when he fell. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le02ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look online for haunted places in a city you know."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose a story."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 6 or 7 sentences to retell the story."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the story to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to your partner's story."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research a haunted place."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write 45 - 50 words about the haunted place."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my story aloud."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to my partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}